        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <p><font size="3" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#990000"><b>Membership 
              Information </b></font></p>
            <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Everyone is 
              welcomed to be NECINA member regardless of race and nationality. 
              NECINA accepts individual member at $25/year and membership will 
              be renewed after every annual meeting in June. </font></p>
            <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Membership 
              Benefits</b><br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> Receive 
              e-mail announcements for all NECINA's activities and related events<br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> Free 
              or discounts for NECINA technical conferences, seminars, as well 
              as social activities. <br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> Expand 
              your personal and career network of contacts through NECINA's global 
              alliances.<br>
              <br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> <b>How 
              to Become a Member of NECINA</b><br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">1. Submit 
              the <a href="adm_new_membership.asp">on-line Membership Application 
              Form</a>, or if your web browser isn't forms-capable, print out<a href="prntform.htm"> 
              this form</a>, fill it out clearly. <br>
              </font><font size="2"></font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">2. 
              Please don't forget to mail your check for $25 membership fee and 
              write down your name on with the application form. <br>
              </font><font size="2"></font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">3. 
              You will receive confirmation email once you have been registered 
              in NECINA membership database.</font></p>
            <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br>
              </font><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>NECINA's 
              mailing address is: <br>
              NECINA<br>
              P.O. Box 1201<br>
              Andover, MA 01810</b></font></p>
            <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">If you have 
              any questions about NECINA's membership, please contact Feng Lin 
              at <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20020601143014if_/mailto:feng@lucent.com%20">feng@lucent.com </a>or Hao 
              Xue at <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20020601143014if_/maito:hxue@astralpoint.com">hxue@astralpoint.com</a> 
              or Jian Cui at <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20020601143014if_/mailto:jian_cui_99@yahoo.com%20">jian_cui_99@yahoo.com 
              </a>or you could just simply send an email to <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20020601143014if_/mailto:necina@necina.org.%20">necina@necina.org. 
              </a> </font></p>
            <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br>
              </font></p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
